tem update9. Add automati","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T12:07:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339021","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613550-1839041357029391","game_id":"steam-4613550","kind":"update","title":"Update Demo V0.4.5","summary":"Add dialogue lines triggered when players recruit NPCs.After bandits seize a building, one bandit will remain to become a resident of that building.Add the function to discard items by dragging them onto empty space.NPCs will automatically pick up and equip clothing with higher value.Add the Miner occupation.Add restricted high-wall zones.Add mechanics for souls absorbing yang energy and spirit possession.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T12:14:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357029391","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613550-1837955055362889","game_id":"steam-4613550","kind":"update","title":"Update Demo V0.4.0","summary":"When a character dies, terracotta figurines will drop separately.When purchasing a property, its residents will become vagrants.Added lock state for buildings.Added character info interface.Added clothing system, along with multiple new portraits, hairstyles and outfits.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T09:23:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055362889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613550-1836506165569945","game_id":"steam-4613550","kind":"update","title":"Update Demo V0.3.0